    "text": "An ideal gas is taken through the cycle&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>A</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>B</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>C</mtext><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>, as shown in the figure. If the net heat supplied to the gas in the cycle is <math> <mrow> <mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>J</mtext></mrow></math>, the work done by the gas in the process <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>C</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>A</mtext></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;is<br />\r<span style=\"line-height: 1.6em;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0135_2389f1d7cf35.jpg\" style=\"line-height: 1.6em; width: 287px; height: 228px;\" />"
